00:15:11.339 --> 00:15:13.550
difference between you and me.

00:15:13.550 --> 00:15:17.559
Killmonger of course said "Just bury me in
the ocean with my ancestors that&nbsp;jumped from

00:15:17.559 --> 00:15:21.290
the ships because they knew death was better
than bondage."

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:27.369
It's up there for me next to lines like "what
is grief if not love perservering" and of

00:15:27.369 --> 00:15:31.600
course "do you know what happens to a toad
when it's struck by lightning"

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:35.209
It's at this moment that the Watcher stares
over everything and we see that Killmonger

00:15:35.209 --> 00:15:40.090
pins it on the Wakandans which leads to the
US government going to war with them. Every

00:15:40.090 --> 00:15:45.309
asset that Stark has is seized and the drones
are mass produced which builds Killmonger

00:15:45.309 --> 00:15:48.319
an army that can take down the Wakandan Kingdom.

00:15:48.319 --> 00:15:53.269
With Klaue he travels into the jungle which
is where the holographic entrance is revealed.

00:15:53.269 --> 00:15:58.559
Klaue calls Killmonger boy and this is often
deemed as a racist term as throughout history

00:15:58.559 --> 00:16:02.579
White people used the phrase when talking
to black people to show that they weren't

00:16:02.579 --> 00:16:04.040
on equal footing.

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:07.869
Much in the same way that Killmonger took
Klaues corpse into Wakanda to infiltrate their

00:16:07.869 --> 00:16:12.589
security he carries him through after murdering
him at point blank range like how he did in

00:16:12.589 --> 00:16:13.589
Black Panther.

00:16:13.589 --> 00:16:17.989
He reveals the tattoo under his lip and this
was something that he did in Black Pantehr

00:16:17.989 --> 00:16:19.670
whilst revealing he was Wakandan to Klaue.

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:24.759
He's taken before the king and we can catch
Okoye to the right hand side. Okoye is the

00:16:24.759 --> 00:16:30.209
only Dora Milaje member to wear Gold and this
is because she is the bodyguard for the King.

00:16:30.209 --> 00:16:34.049
It's at this point that T'chaka reveals that
he kept Killmonger hidden and this action

00:16:34.049 --> 00:16:39.089
of course came back to bite the Wakandans
in Black Panther much like how it does here.

00:16:39.089 --> 00:16:45.160
Similar to Tony he's now operating as somewhat
of a Trojan horse and hiding his true intentions.

00:16:45.160 --> 00:16:49.589
He lied about his father being murdered by
a gang and T'chaka clearly only accepts him

00:16:49.589 --> 00:16:54.989
because he believes he doesn't know the truth.
Shuri is the only one who suspects anything

00:16:54.989 --> 00:16:57.189
and it shows off her true intellect.

00:16:57.189 --> 00:16:58.869
The Americans roll in and under Killmongers
command we watch as they wait on the outskirts

00:16:58.869 --> 00:17:01.499
of Wakanda in a scene that feels very similar
to the battle there that happened at the end

00:17:01.499 --> 00:17:02.499
of Infinity War.

00:17:02.499 --> 00:17:03.499
Cut to the Drone centre in Nevada where Ross
leads the charge and the shields are opened

00:17:03.499 --> 00:17:04.499
much like how they were in IW.

00:17:04.499 --> 00:17:07.880
Their power is seemingly destroyed but this
is actually a ruse by Killmonger who activates

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:18.230
the drones, this time under his control. It
leads to an epic final act in which Killmonger

00:17:18.230 --> 00:17:22.890
rides into battle against the Drones on the
back of a Rhino. These were of course used

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:29.019
in the finale of Black Panther and Erik pretty
much can't lose because the Drones are of

00:17:29.019 --> 00:17:30.830
course inder his command.

00:17:30.830 --> 00:17:35.559
It's very much a false flag attack that paints
him out as the hero and he saves Okoye's life

00:17:35.559 --> 00:17:40.159
which wins the trust of the Wakandans. The
drones are destroyed and Killmonger stabs

00:17:40.159 --> 00:17:44.470
one through the stark logo summising the destruction
of his legacy.

00:17:44.470 --> 00:17:48.789
We cut to the Wakandan sunset and in Black
Panther Killmonger remarked on how his father

00:17:48.789 --> 00:17:53.000
said that they had the most beautiful ones
in the world. Whereas he died whilst looking

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:57.000
over them this is the beginning of a new chapter
in his life.

00:17:57.000 --> 00:18:00.640
He convinces T'Chaka that he should reach
out to their brothers and sisters who are

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:05.340
in dire need across the world and T'Chaka
agrees with him. This was of course his plan

00:18:05.340 --> 00:18:10.070
in Black Panther but going about it this way
has worked out way better for him.

00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:14.700
He becomes the black panther and is given
the herb that allows one to have the power.

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:19.130
On the ancestral plane he sees the spirit
of T'Challa who appears in his white garb

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:23.809
much like how he did in the film. The pair
debate back and forther and it really shows

00:18:23.809 --> 00:18:28.350
the difference between the characters as we
watch Killmonger suit up in the gold uniform

00:18:28.350 --> 00:18:30.150
that he had in the movie.

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:34.550
We see Tony's image is used in memorial and
simialr things of course happened in Far From

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:39.809
Home in which he becames an inspiring figure
due to his sacrifice. The poster says only

00:18:39.809 --> 00:18:45.260
you can Avenge Tony Stark and ey, no prize
for guessing the wordplay there.

00:18:45.260 --> 00:18:50.450
Pepper sees the folly in attacking Wakanda
and she finds Shuri in her office who of course

00:18:50.450 --> 00:18:53.260
suspected that her cousin wasn't all that
he seemed to be.

00:18:53.260 --> 00:18:57.970
Now we know from the teasers for What If that
Shuri and Pepper will be working together

00:18:57.970 --> 00:19:02.700
so expect to see a continuation of this story
at some point in the season.

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:05.831
Now if you've been checking out the trailers
for What If them you'll know theres a big

00:19:05.831 --> 00:19:10.429
Avengers assemble moment with several of the
characters from across the series. Amongst

00:19:10.429 --> 00:19:16.390
