Thanora and lastly Killmonger in his own Black

00:19:16.390 --> 00:19:17.390
Panther uniform.

00:19:17.390 --> 00:19:21.440
I think that the series is clearly heading
towards a big big team up moment that will

00:19:21.440 --> 00:19:25.650
